215
00:15:38,174 --> 00:15:42,904
Now, out of the lab. Picture this: an LLM
application team rewrote the history of

216
00:15:42,944 --> 00:15:47,557
its retrieval service to remove a customer
export. The rewrite was verified and

217
00:15:47,597 --> 00:15:50,855
